    {
      "id": "be-s12m-perfect-competition-c3",
      "heading": "Worked example: P = $10",
      "explanation_md": "Given **P = $10** and **C(Q) = 5 + Q²**:\n\n- MR = P = $10, and **MC = 2Q**\n- 10 = 2Q, so **Q = 5 units**\n- Profit = PQ - C(Q) = (10)(5) - (5 + 25) = **$20**",
